{"seq":18,"slug":"information-economics","title":"信息经济学","stage":"DONE","category":"economics-finance","chapterCount":5,"docCount":16,"url":"/h/economics-finance/information-economics","rating":{"composite":3.61,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 信息经济学\n\n信息经济学研究在信息不完全、尤其是信息分布不对称的条件下，经济主体如何决策、市场如何运行。买二手车时卖家比你更懂车况，买保险时你比保险公司更清楚自己的风险——这种「信息不对称」无处不在，深刻地影响着市场、合约与制度。信息经济学打破了传统经济学的「完全信息」假设，揭示了信息的分布如何系统性地塑造经济，是二十世纪经济学最重要的革命之一，奠基者多次荣获诺贝尔经济学奖。\n\n本 hub 面向希望理解「信息如何影响经济」的读者，无需深厚的经济学背景，循序渐进地讲解信息不对称的两大问题及其应对机制。\n\n第一章「基础与信息不对称」界定信息不对称的含义、隐藏信息（事前）与隐藏行动（事后）两种类型、它如何导致市场失灵，及应对机制概览。第二章「逆向选择与柠檬市场」剖析事前隐藏信息引发的逆向选择——阿克洛夫的柠檬市场模型如何揭示劣质驱逐优质、市场崩溃。第三章「信号传递与信息甄别」考察两种克服信息鸿沟的巧妙机制：信息优势方主动「发信号」、信息劣势方设计「甄别机制」。第四章「道德风险」剖析事后隐藏行动引发的问题——有了保障就不再审慎，及其应对。第五章「委托代理与应用」讲委托代理问题与契约设计，并纵览信息经济学在保险、金融、劳动、平台等领域的应用与深远意义。\n\n建议按章节顺序阅读。始终把握一条主线：信息不对称无处不在，它会系统性地破坏本可互利的市场（逆向选择）、扭曲本应尽责的行为（道德风险）；而人类发展出种种巧妙的机制（信号、甄别、契约、激励）来应对它——理解这一切，是理解现代市场、合约与制度何以如此运作的钥匙。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础与信息不对称","docCount":3,"url":"/h/economics-finance/information-economics/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-information-economics","title":"什么是信息经济学","url":"/h/economics-finance/information-economics/foundations/what-is-information-economics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"types-of-asymmetry","title":"信息不对称的两种类型","url":"/h/economics-finance/information-economics/foundations/types-of-asymmetry"},{"seq":3,"slug":"market-failure-and-mechanisms","title":"市场失灵与应对机制概览","url":"/h/economics-finance/information-economics/foundations/market-failure-and-mechanisms"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"adverse-selection","title":"逆向选择与柠檬市场","docCount":3,"url":"/h/economics-finance/information-economics/adverse-selection","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"lemon-market","title":"柠檬市场：经典模型","url":"/h/economics-finance/information-economics/adverse-selection/lemon-market"},{"seq":2,"slug":"insurance-and-remedies","title":"保险市场中的逆向选择","url":"/h/economics-finance/information-economics/adverse-selection/insurance-and-remedies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"market-collapse-significance","title":"市场崩溃的意义","url":"/h/economics-finance/information-economics/adverse-selection/market-collapse-significance"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"signaling-and-screening","title":"信号传递与信息甄别","docCount":3,"url":"/h/economics-finance/information-economics/signaling-and-screening","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"signaling","title":"信号传递","url":"/h/economics-finance/information-economics/signaling-and-screening/signaling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"screening","title":"信息甄别","url":"/h/economics-finance/information-economics/signaling-and-screening/screening"},{"seq":3,"slug":"separating-pooling","title":"分离均衡与混同均衡","url":"/h/economics-finance/information-economics/signaling-and-screening/separating-pooling"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"moral-hazard","title":"道德风险","docCount":3,"url":"/h/economics-finance/information-economics/moral-hazard","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-moral-hazard","title":"什么是道德风险","url":"/h/economics-finance/information-economics/moral-hazard/what-is-moral-hazard"},{"seq":2,"slug":"examples","title":"道德风险的广泛例子","url":"/h/economics-finance/information-economics/moral-hazard/examples"},{"seq":3,"slug":"remedies","title":"道德风险的应对","url":"/h/economics-finance/information-economics/moral-hazard/remedies"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"principal-agent-and-applications","title":"委托代理与应用","docCount":4,"url":"/h/economics-finance/information-economics/principal-agent-and-applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"principal-agent","title":"委托代理问题","url":"/h/economics-finance/information-economics/principal-agent-and-applications/principal-agent"},{"seq":2,"slug":"contract-design","title":"契约设计与激励相容","url":"/h/economics-finance/information-economics/principal-agent-and-applications/contract-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"applications","title":"信息经济学的应用","url":"/h/economics-finance/information-economics/principal-agent-and-applications/applications"},{"seq":4,"slug":"significance","title":"信息经济学的意义与启示","url":"/h/economics-finance/information-economics/principal-agent-and-applications/significance"}]}]}